  FirstTimeDialogue:
  - I am cheese, I am cheese.
  ReturnedDialogue:
  - 'Mice love to bounce around from one place to another. '
  - "Squeak, you can\u2019t beat me.  "
  - 'Laugh all you want,  '
  - ' but one day I will be known throughout the world. '
